quran[23]{c,v,t}:
  56,77,It is indeed a Noble Qur’an.
  56,78,"(Before this, it was written) in a Hidden, Guarded Book (al-Lawh al-Mahfuz)."
  56,79,None shall touch it except the purified ones.
  56,80,(It is) a piecemeal revelation from the Lord of all worlds.
  56,81,Do you then take this discourse lightly?
  56,82,Do you make your means of subsistence through your (act of) rejecting (it)?
  56,83,"Why, then, when it (i.e. the soul of a dying person) reaches the throat (to pass out of his body),"
  56,84,you are looking on (miserably) at that moment?
  56,85,"And We are nearer to him (i.e. the dying person) than you are, but you cannot see (Us)."
  56,86,"If you are not subject to (Our) command,"
  56,87,why do you not bring that (soul) back if you are truthful?
  56,88,"If that (dying person) is one among those brought near (to Us),"
  56,89,"then (such a person will have) comfort, fragrance and a Garden of Bliss."
  56,90,"And if he is one among the people of the Right Hand,"
  56,91,then (he will be told:) ‘Peace be on you from the people of the Right Hand!’
  56,92,"But if he is one among the deniers, the misguided ones,"
  56,93,"then (he will have) a hospitality of boiling water,"
  56,94,and burning in the Hellfire.
  56,95,"Indeed, this is the truth of absolute Certainty."
  56,96,"So glorify the Name of your Lord, the All-Magnificent."
  57,1,"Whatever is in the heavens and the earth glorifies Allah, and He is the All-Mighty, the All-Wise."
  57,2,To Him belongs the kingdom of the heavens and the earth. He gives life and causes death. And He is All-Capable of everything.
  57,3,"He is the First and the Last, the Manifest and the Hidden. And He is All-Knowing of everything."
